{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in a multiprofile RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 encoder, building on prior evidence of multiprofile and encoder benefits. Validation accuracy (0.653) and F1 (0.628) are slightly higher than the avgpool baseline (config_003), suggesting potential advantages of transformer aggregation, though the small difference remains uncertain. The role of fusion strategies and isolated impact of aggregation methods on performance are still unexplored."
}

